### Greed Island — cast attempts
# Run each request with the green ▶ gutter arrow in IntelliJ.
# App must be running (TestGreedIslandServerApplication) on :8080.

@host = http://localhost:8080

### 1. Success, no vow — Gon (Enhancer, 500) punches with Jajanken: Rock (60)
# expect: Success, auraSpent 60
POST {{host}}/casts/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "gon",
  "hatsuId": "jajanken-rock",
  "currentHour": 12
}

### 2. Success via LifeStake — Gon casts First Comes Rock (250 - 200 discount)
# expect: Success, auraSpent 50
POST {{host}}/casts/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "gon",
  "hatsuId": "first-comes-rock",
  "currentHour": 12
}

### 3. Target vow SATISFIED — Kurapika chains a Troupe member (chrollo)
# expect: Success, auraSpent 125 (200 - 75)
POST {{host}}/casts/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "kurapika",
  "hatsuId": "chain-jail",
  "currentHour": 12,
  "targetId": "chrollo"
}

### 4. Target vow BROKEN — Kurapika aims Chain Jail at a non-Troupe target (gon)
# expect: VowConditionsNotMet
POST {{host}}/casts/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "kurapika",
  "hatsuId": "chain-jail",
  "currentHour": 12,
  "targetId": "gon"
}

### 5. Time vow SATISFIED — Killua casts Moonlit Edge at 22:00 (window 20-04)
# expect: Success, auraSpent 140 (180 - 40)
POST {{host}}/casts/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "killua",
  "hatsuId": "moonlit-edge",
  "currentHour": 22
}

### 6. Time vow BROKEN — same ability at noon
# expect: VowConditionsNotMet
POST {{host}}/casts/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "killua",
  "hatsuId": "moonlit-edge",
  "currentHour": 12
}

### 7. Specialization wall — Gon (Enhancer) tries a Specialization ability
# expect: NotEnoughAura, required = Infinity
POST {{host}}/casts/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "gon",
  "hatsuId": "final-gambit",
  "currentHour": 1
}

### 8. Double vow, right caster — Chrollo (Specialist) casts Final Gambit at 01:00
# expect: Success (Specialist can cast it; time + life-stake discounts apply)
POST {{host}}/casts/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "chrollo",
  "hatsuId": "final-gambit",
  "currentHour": 1
}

### 9. Unknown user — no such id in the store
# expect: error (NoSuchElementException surfaces as HTTP 500 for now)
POST {{host}}/casts/attempt
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "userId": "ging",
  "hatsuId": "jajanken-rock",
  "currentHour": 12
}
